Package: com.michaelmelita.ytglass
Name: YTGlass
Version: 0.0.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Liquid Glass tweaks for YouTube. Hides YouTube's tab bar when scrolling, adds a round glass search button next to it, and replaces the top navigation bar with an Apple Music-style status bar blur and large titles. Also gives the video player Liquid Glass controls. Add-on for YTPlus's Liquid Glass tab bar.
Maintainer: Michael Melita
Author: Michael Melita (scroll tracking from YTKACE by itzzace; blur from BlurUIKit by Tim Oliver)
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
